OL,3,GNEWSARefuse workers strike action over
OL,4,Apay halted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for further strike action by
OL,7,Fwaste collectors and street cleaners
OL,8,Fhas been called off "following last
OL,9,Fminute negotiations", a union said.
OL,11,FOne third of Great Yarmouth Services
OL,12,F(GYS) workers, which also included
OL,13,Flandscapers and grave diggers, withdrew
OL,14,Ftheir labour earlier this month after
OL,15,Ftheir demand for a 20% pay increase was
OL,16,Frejected and they were offered a 3.3%
OL,17,Frise.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
PN,37602
