PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F376A1787736356
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARefuse workers strike action over
OL,4,Apay halted
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndreas Kucher, a Unite the Union
OL,7,Fregional officer, said: "In the spirit
OL,8,Fof good relations our members at GYS
OL,9,Fagreed to suspend today's strike
OL,10,Faction, negotiate, and hopefully agree
OL,11,Fon a suitable offer which can be
OL,12,Fbrought to the members."
OL,14,FGreat Yarmouth Borough Council owns GYS
OL,15,Fand has been contacted for comment.
